@startuml http_test_agent_architecture
' Source evidence: pi-mono-java commit 1f801dbb82bdda30478e3354e685e3153b179a0c.
' Source paths: modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/web/RuntimeSessionController.java.
' Source paths: modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/web/RuntimeEventController.java.
' Test paths: modules/coding-agent-cli/src/test/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/web/RuntimeHttpProcessOpenGaussIT.java.
' Observed behavior: route tests and opt-in process/OpenGauss integration tests exist, but default CI only runs Maven verify.
' Design reason: deterministic contract and state oracles must remain authoritative while the agent plans, launches, and maintains tests.
' Target-only: recommended test-platform assembly; implementation evidence remains scoped to the baseline.

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
top to bottom direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam nodesep 25
skinparam ranksep 35
skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  BorderColor #64748B
}
title Runtime HTTP Test Adapter - Target Structure
actor "CI / Developer" as Trigger
package "Inputs and planning" {
  [Baseline Resolver] as Baseline
  [Contract Extractor] as Extractor
  [Change Impact Analyzer] as Impact
  [Test Planner] as Planner
  artifact "Immutable test plan" as Plan
}
package "Execution" {
  [Environment Provisioner] as Env
  [Test Executor] as Executor
  [Deterministic Oracle] as Oracle
}
package "Test boundaries" {
  node "Isolated environment\nJAR / openGauss / model stub\nAgent fixture / local ports" as Environment
  [HTTP and state layers\nL0-L6 adapters] as Layers
}
package "Evidence and maintenance" {
  artifact "Evidence bundle" as Evidence
  [Case Maintenance Proposer] as Maintainer
  artifact "Verdict / catalog proposal" as Result
}
artifact "Pinned Git commits" as Git
artifact "Historical HTTP 1.37\nreview model + case catalog" as Contract

Trigger --> Baseline
Git --> Baseline
Contract --> Extractor
Baseline --> Impact
Extractor --> Impact
Impact --> Planner
Planner --> Plan
Plan --> Env
Plan --> Executor
Env --> Environment
Env -[hidden]down-> Executor
Executor -[hidden]down-> Oracle
Executor --> Layers
Layers --> Environment : run against
Layers -down-> Oracle : results
Oracle --> Evidence
Oracle --> Result : deterministic verdict
Impact --> Maintainer : contract / coverage gap
Evidence --> Maintainer
Maintainer --> Result : reviewable proposal

legend bottom left
Historical contract adapter; current Runtime migration is a separate requirement.
The immutable plan retains every P0 invariant; unknown impact selects all layers.
Required environment and tests must run; skip never means pass.
The Agent can propose cases; checked-in assertions determine the verdict.
Grouped environments and layers are collaborators, not replacement classes.
endlegend
@enduml

@startuml http_test_execution_sequence
' Source evidence: pi-mono-java commit 1f801dbb82bdda30478e3354e685e3153b179a0c.
' CI path: .github/workflows/ci.yml.
' Process test path: modules/coding-agent-cli/src/test/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/web/RuntimeHttpProcessOpenGaussIT.java.
' Observed behavior: integration tests require explicit JAR and OpenGauss properties and can skip when prerequisites are absent.
' Design reason: required gates must provision dependencies and fail closed instead of silently skipping.
' Target-only: recommended test-platform assembly; implementation evidence remains scoped to the baseline.

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
hide footbox
skinparam maxMessageSize 210
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  ParticipantBorderColor #64748B
  LifeLineBorderColor #94A3B8
  GroupBorderColor #CBD5E1
  GroupBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
}
title HTTP Regression - Plan, Run, Verify
actor "CI / Developer" as Caller
participant "HTTP Adapter" as Agent
participant "Git / Contract" as Source
participant "Environment" as Env
participant "Runner / Oracle" as Runner
database "Evidence Store" as Store

== 1. Freeze baseline and plan ==
Caller -> Agent : test(candidate, mergeBase, mode)
Agent -> Source : Resolve commits / contract hash
Source --> Agent : Immutable baseline or error
break Baseline missing or ambiguous
  Agent --> Caller : BLOCKED_BASELINE
end
Agent -> Source : Extract operations / changed symbols
Source --> Agent : Contract snapshot and diff
Agent -> Agent : Plan required cases\nUnknown or large impact selects all

== 2. Provision and run ==
Agent -> Env : Create isolated resources
Env --> Agent : Readiness evidence
alt Required dependency unavailable
  Agent -> Env : Collect diagnostics / clean up
  Env --> Agent : Cleanup result
  Agent --> Caller : FAIL_ENVIRONMENT
else Ready
  Agent -> Runner : Execute L0 and fast contracts
  Runner -> Runner : Check foundation gate
  opt Foundation passed
    Runner -> Runner : Run required state, DB and process tests
  end
  Runner -> Store : Manifest, results, logs and seeds
  Store --> Runner : Evidence stored

  == 3. Clean up and report ==
  Agent -> Env : Clean up / check resource leaks
  Env --> Agent : Cleanup evidence
  Agent -> Runner : Finalize verdict with cleanup result
  Runner --> Agent : Deterministic verdict / gaps
  Agent --> Caller : Report + maintenance proposal
end
@enduml

@startuml http_test_case_maintenance
' Contract evidence: design repository chat-http-v1-review.html version 1.37.0.
' Test evidence: pi-mono-java commit 1f801dbb82bdda30478e3354e685e3153b179a0c runtime API route and process tests.
' Observed behavior at the recorded baseline: tests are code-owned and do not have a separate requirement-to-case inventory.
' Design reason: case changes must be reviewable, traceable, and unable to weaken an accepted contract automatically.
' Target-only: recommended test-platform assembly; implementation evidence remains scoped to the baseline.

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
title HTTP Case Maintenance - Preserve the Oracle
start
partition "Find the change" {
  :Read pinned contract and candidate diff;
  if (Contract changed?) then (yes)
    :Propose contract-to-case updates;
  elseif (Behavior or route changed?) then (yes)
    :Map symbols and propose regression cases;
  else (no)
    :Keep catalog;
  endif
}
partition "Validate and review" {
  :Run catalog checks and selected tests;
  if (Weaken or remove an assertion?) then (yes)
    :Require contract evidence and human review;
    if (Approved?) then (yes)
      :Record replacement and version;
    else (no)
      :Reject update;
      stop
    endif
  else (no)
    :Submit additive proposal for review;
  endif
}
partition "Keep traceability" {
  if (Retirement confirmed by contract?) then (yes)
    :Retire case with replacement reference;
    :Keep route tombstone test;
  else (no)
    :Keep active case IDs;
  endif
  :Deliver when catalog, code and evidence agree;
}
stop
@enduml
